{"channel": "code-review", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2024-11-26T16:03:29+00:00", "text": "That's what keeps cache_stats cheap on a cold process - you can rebuild the whole hit/miss picture from the metadata DB without constructing anything", "id": "m-code-review-2024-11-26-414"}
